===Etymology===
{{root|en|ine-pro|*ten-}}
From {{inh|en|enm|entretenement|t=support, maintenance}}, from {{der|en|fro|entretenement}}; see {{m|en|entertain}}. Morphologically {{af|en|entertain|-ment}}.

